TITLE Equilibrate Ca solution with calcite gypsum aragonite and gas phase
SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    units     mmol/kgw
    pH        7 charge
    Ca        50
    C(4)      0
    S(6)      0
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite   0 0.03645
    Gypsum    0 0.03645
    Aragonite 0 0.03645
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 16
    -temperature 25
    CO2(g)    1.0
    CH4(g)    5.0
    H2S(g)    10.0
END
